{"obsah":"<p>Our Trialshow.cz team, which includes a large number of the Bikeskills project instructors, is slowly starting to develop a partnership with CUBE, the largest bike manufacturer in Europe.</p>\n\n<p>The first swallow of this partnership was Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček signing a contract to promote the brand, followed straight away by this year's first exhibition at the opening of the CUBE STORE Karlovy Vary, hosted by the exceptional Marek Eben.</p>\n\n<p>A luxurious, stylish shop full of bikes is a rarity these days. Vlasta and Martin Šimůnek jumped over the ribbon meant to be cut (and almost cut it with a chain on one of the jumps), and did a short show on small obstacles.</p>\n\n<p>Martin Šimůnek then saddled a small kids' bike and showed that it's no problem to ride on the back wheel or hop on the front wheel even on an 18\" bike :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc24.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc24.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202006\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc41.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc41.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202009\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc40.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc40.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202008\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc39.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc39.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202010\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc38.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc38.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202007\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc37.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc37.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202011\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc36.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc36.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-202015\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F02%2Fc35.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%